          "description": "There’s a heat wave in the garden today and everyone is trying to stay cool! Greta and Sunny learn all about yellow foods: corn, pineapple, lemons and more. Spider, Worm and Butterfly tell the story of “The Yellow Corn Maze”, they learn how to make Frozen Banana Pops, and they end their sunshine-y day with a game of “Yellow or Not Yellow.”",
